{% comment %}
  Main policy section — renders policy pages.
  ⚠️ PRIVACY POLICY OVERRIDE (2026-10-08, lead-monetization project): privacy-policy renders
  theme content because the Admin API token lacks write_legal_policies scope. If the policy is
  updated in Admin → Settings → Policies, remove the privacy branch and keep the fallback only.
{% endcomment %}

{% if policy.handle == 'privacy-policy' %}
<div class="simple-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="simple-page-content">
      <h1 class="simple-page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <p><strong>Last Updated: October 8, 2026</strong></p>
        <p>Barnhaus Steel Designs ("we," "us") operates this store. We are affiliated with Barnhaus Steel Builders, and this policy covers both. This policy explains how we collect, use, and share your information when you browse the store, use our cost calculator, sign up for design credits, or make a purchase.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact details</strong>: name, email, phone number, and shipping/billing address</li>
          <li><strong>Order information</strong>: items purchased and transaction details (payment data is processed by Shopify and our payment processors — we never store full card numbers)</li>
          <li><strong>Calculator and design inputs</strong>: project specifications and preferences</li>
          <li><strong>Device and usage data</strong>: IP address, browser type, pages visited</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Processing orders and delivering products</li>
          <li>Responding to inquiries and providing design services and credit tracking</li>
          <li>Following up about your project by phone, email, and text</li>
          <li>Matching you with service providers you choose (see below)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>How We Share Your Information</h2>
        <p><strong>Service providers.</strong> Shopify (our store platform), payment processors, and delivery services — each receives only what they need to perform their function.</p>
        <p><strong>Partners you choose.</strong> If you tell us you want help — for example, asking us to connect you with kit suppliers, financing, builders, or land specialists — we may share your contact and project information with those partner categories so they can contact you about their services. We may receive compensation for these connections. We share with a partner category only if you asked for that kind of help. We do not sell your information to data brokers or advertising networks. Under some state laws this is a "sale" — you can opt out anytime via <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a>.</p>
        <p><strong>Other disclosures.</strong> As required by law, to enforce our terms, or in a business transfer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>SMS / Text Communications</h2>
        <p>If you opt into texts, we may contact you by SMS about your order, project, or inquiry using automated technology. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help. Partner contact works the same as described on our main website privacy policy at <a href="https://barnhaussteelbuilders.com/privacy">barnhaussteelbuilders.com/privacy</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Access: request a copy of the information we hold about you</li>
          <li>Deletion: request deletion of your information</li>
          <li>Correction: correct inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Opt out: of communications and partner sharing at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a>. We respond within 30 days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Refunds &amp; Orders</h2>
        <p>See our Refund Policy for order-related terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Larry Madison · Barnhaus Steel Designs · <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18304076296">(830) 407-6296</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .simple-page { padding: 60px 0; }
  .simple-page-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .simple-page-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid #B8860B; padding-bottom: 16px; }
  .simple-page-block { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .simple-page-block h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .simple-page-block p { color: #ccc; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .simple-page-block ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 20px; }
  .simple-page-block li { color: #ccc; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .simple-page-block a { color: #B8860B; }
</style>
{% else %}
<div class="simple-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="simple-page-content">
      <h1 class="simple-page-title">{{ policy.title }}</h1>
      <div class="simple-page-block">{{ policy.body }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .simple-page { padding: 60px 0; }
  .simple-page-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .simple-page-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid #B8860B; padding-bottom: 16px; }
  .simple-page-block { color: #ccc; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .simple-page-block a { color: #B8860B; }
</style>
{% endif %}
